  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Peacock Egg.png|200px|left|Peacock Egg|link=Special:FilePath/Peacock Egg.png]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |Chocolate bunny = 30\n |level = 54\n |time = 1h 30m\n |source = {{Infoicon|eastereggmaker|bigger|link=Easter Egg Maker}}\n |xp = 59\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1h 21m\n}}\n'''Peacock Egg''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 54. It's a special item used only for the Easter 2023 event.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making Peacock Egg'''===\n[[File:Easter Egg Maker.png|150px|left|Easter Egg Maker|link=Special:FilePath/Easter Egg Maker.png]]\nPeacock eggs are made in the [[Easter Egg Maker]].\n\nTo make a peacock egg, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Pineapple.png|75px|Pineapple|link=Pineapple]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Toffee.png|75px|Toffee|link=Toffee]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour 30 minutes to make an egg, and 1 hour 21 minutes in a 2-star and fully [[Masteries|mastered]] station. Each egg gives players 59 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 egg per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each egg used on a boat will be rewarded with 30 [[Chocolate Bunny]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Easter Egg Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Pineapple Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:Toffee Products]]\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Huevo de pavo real\n|de = Pfauenei\n}}",
